     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So, I did this.<div><br><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SPG Shiny Applications&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> collapsible </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>                 navbarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Production&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BreedingInventory&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BreedingInventory&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BreedTarget&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BreedTarget&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                          <br>                            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> htmlOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;iframe&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br> observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">BreedingInventory</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tags$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">src </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;app1url&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seamless</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1000px&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;100%&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scrolling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;no&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">BreedTarget</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tags$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">src </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;app2url&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seamless</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1000px&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;100%&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scrolling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;no&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>However, it looks ugly, very!</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--SP6h6PSFNI/V9xEv4hAuVI/AAAAAAAAADo/Q3-aG5e_kD4Umj98h4kDtq2t9NwkhTpFwCLcB/s1600/123.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--SP6h6PSFNI/V9xEv4hAuVI/AAAAAAAAADo/Q3-aG5e_kD4Umj98h4kDtq2t9NwkhTpFwCLcB/s1600/123.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391999499000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3TAxwRtzWcXxa7ro55PbFy\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--SP6h6PSFNI/V9xEv4hAuVI/AAAAAAAAADo/Q3-aG5e_kD4Umj98h4kDtq2t9NwkhTpFwCLcB/s1600/123.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p></div></div>"
