     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I found another good way to solve it!<div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;appID&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">collapsible </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>                 tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Home&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 navbarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Production&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;a&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;production/a/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;b&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;production/b/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;c&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;production/c/&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  <br>  output$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$appID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Home&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tags$h1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Welcome to Home Page!&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tags$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">src </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;URURL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$appID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seamless</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1000px&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;100%&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scrolling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;no&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">Here must be a tabpanel before <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace\">navbarMenu</span>, otherwise we will get weird bugs!</span></div><div><br></div></div>"
